&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason
of the excessive amount of parking provision for a retail development in an out
of centre location would give rise to a car dependent development and would
fail to contribute to the aims and objectives of sustainable transport,
contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024) and policies T1, T2,
T4C, T6.3A, B,
D &lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;of
the London Plan (2021) and policy DM 42 of the Harrow Development Management
Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;_com_1&quot; class=&quot;msocomtxt&quot; language=&quot;JavaScript&quot;&gt;

